 # builds, with MFront (the variable MFRONT, or the program mfront found in
 # the path), in the directory <dir> = <current binary directory>/<target>:
 #
 # - the libraries for the CPU, generated by the generic interface:
 #   <dir>/cpu/lib<name>.so;
-# - if MFEM is built with CUDA (resp. HIP) and the configuration file
-#   config-cuda-nvcc.json (resp. config-hip-hipcc.json) is provided by TFEL,
